# CODEOWNERS - Required reviews before merge
# See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default: Tech Lead reviews everything
* @tech-lead

# Security-sensitive paths require security reviewer
packages/authorization/ @tech-lead @security-reviewer
apps/api/src/modules/identity/ @tech-lead @security-reviewer
apps/api/src/modules/audit/ @tech-lead @security-reviewer

# Privacy vault - extra protection
apps/api/src/modules/privacy-vault/ @tech-lead @security-reviewer @privacy-approver

# Infrastructure changes
infra/ @tech-lead @devops-lead
.github/ @tech-lead @devops-lead

# Evidence pipeline
apps/api/src/modules/evidence/ @tech-lead @security-reviewer
apps/worker/src/media/ @tech-lead @security-reviewer

# ADR changes require architect sign-off
docs/adr/ @tech-lead

# Migration files require DBA review
apps/api/src/database/migrations/ @tech-lead @dba
